---
import AvailabilityBadge from "./AvailabilityBadge.astro";
import Skills from "./Skills.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-white pt-[4em] pb-[3em]">
  <header class="py-[2em] md:mt-[1em]">
    <img
      src="https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/07cace5d941b67f22d030088283a10f0?s=400"
      alt="Frédéric Maquin / Ephread"
      width="400"
      height="400"
      class="mx-auto block size-[10em] rounded-full"
    />
  </header>

  <AvailabilityBadge />

  <div class="text-area p-[2em] pt-[1em] pb-[5em]">
    <p>I'm an independent iOS, watchOS and tvOS developer based in Montréal. 🇨🇦 I help companies build amazing apps.</p>
  </div>

  <Skills />

  <div class="text-area p-[2em] pt-[1em] pb-[5em]">
    <p>
      Whether you need assistance with app development, from designing the user interface to publishing fully-functional
      applications, I'm here to help. My code is designed to be easy to understand, maintainable, and testable.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can check out some of my <a href="https://github.com/ephread">open source work</a> or take a look at my entire
      work history on <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/ephread/">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you think we should make great apps together, you can <a href="#get-in-touch">hire me</a>!
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
